{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41199","headline":"清明赤水寺居 · 罗衮","name":"清明赤水寺居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"榆火轻烟处处新，旋从闲望到诸邻。\n浮生浮世祗多事，野水野花娱病身。\n浊酒不禁云外景，碧峰犹冷寺前春。\n蓑衣毳衲诚吾党，自结村园一社贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}